MODIFICATIONS (per Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): all files listed above were
modified from the originals. Each was loudness-normalized to -16 LUFS,
downmixed to mono, resampled to 44.1 kHz, re-encoded at 96 kbps, given a
short output fade, and renamed. squeaker.mp3 was additionally pitch-shifted
up and tempo-adjusted from the original toot.mp3.

Original filename mapping:
    toot.mp3      <- sounds/toot.mp3
    squeaker.mp3  <- sounds/toot.mp3  (pitch-shifted)
    wet.mp3       <- sounds/wet.mp3
    dry.mp3       <- sounds/dry.mp3
    ripper.mp3    <- sounds/needs-you.mp3
    trumpet.mp3   <- sounds/success.mp3
    bubbler.mp3   <- sounds/poop-toot.mp3
    thunder.mp3   <- sounds/hellacious.mp3
    marathon.mp3  <- sounds/done-long.mp3

